%N A401022 Largest 3-smooth divisor of n*(n+1).
%H A401022 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A401022/b401022.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A401022 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/933">Erdős Problem 933</a>, Erdős Problems.
%F A401022 a(n) = A065331(n*(n+1)) = A065331(n) * A065331(n+1).
%o A401022 (PARI) a(n) = 2^valuation(n*(n+1), 2)*3^valuation(n*(n+1), 3);
%o A401022 (Python)
%o A401022 from sympy import multiplicity
%o A401022 def A401022(n): return 3**multiplicity(3, (m:=n*(n+1)))<<(~m&m-1).bit_length() # _Chai Wah Wu_, Oct 14 2026
